From 7e29ff7905dee62937fec57c1386a7b3123318d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:55:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Account a development coinbase through AdvanceMonetary.

the leading flags-2 input is not an ordinary spend; non-burn outputs become coinbase coins; AdvanceMonetary receives their sums and the encoded size; tx frame prefix stays 0; a bare development genesis cannot pay the byte charge; a fee-funded block can; prev id is the parent BlockId and prev index is the candidate height; not ConnectTip; lotusd has not accepted a V2 block.
